{
    "id":  10342,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "7W Black Round LED Downlight - Adjustable - UGR19 - CCT Selectable Color",
    "reference":  "LSPL7W-CCT-91270",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlack recessed spotlight - UGR19 -\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eAdjustable circular LED\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003e7W \u003c/strong\u003eof power. With an opening angle of\u003cstrong\u003e 60º\u003c/strong\u003e, so the illumination is more direct to focus the light on specific points. It stands out because it can\u003cstrong\u003e rotate 360º and rotate 24º\u003c/strong\u003e getting a lighting to any space of interest.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCCT\u003c/strong\u003e technology, the white \u003cstrong\u003elight\u003c/strong\u003e can be selected in \u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K and 6000K\u003c/strong\u003e. Easy assembly and installation.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eRecessed LED 7W Circular Black - Adjustable - UGR19 - CCT\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eimagine perfection in lighting: the \u003cstrong\u003e7W Black Circular LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is much more than a simple luminaire; it is a masterpiece of lighting technology. Once you discover it, you\u0027ll never want to go back to conventional lighting again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow glare: Low UGR.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA luminaire with a \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u003c/strong\u003e (Unified Glare Rating) of \u003cstrong\u003e19\u003c/strong\u003e or lower offers several advantages in environments where adequate illumination and \u003cstrong\u003eglare reduction\u003c/strong\u003e are required. UGR is a parameter that evaluates the visual discomfort caused by glare in a lighting environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis means that the lighting is softer and less bothersome for people who work, study, or are in the illuminated space. An environment with less glare enhances visual comfort and reduces eye fatigue. By reducing glare, it\u0027s possible to achieve more efficient lighting, as a lower amount of general or accent lighting can be used to achieve the same level of visibility. This can contribute to energy consumption reduction and, therefore, cost savings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow UGR lighting creates a more pleasant and inviting atmosphere, which can have a positive impact on the well-being and productivity of individuals in that space. A more comfortable and attractive environment can increase user satisfaction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdaptive Brightness:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne of the most amazing features of this LED downlight is its ability to change the color of the light to your liking. Thanks to its innovative switch on the back of the fixture, you can select from\u003cstrong\u003e three color options: warm white, neutral or cool\u003c/strong\u003e. Want to create a cozy atmosphere in your living room? Need a bright, focused light in your work space? Choose cool white. Maybe something in between for a versatile room? Neutral white is the perfect choice  you\u0027re in total control!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutstanding Energy Efficiency:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a \u003cstrong\u003epower output\u003c/strong\u003e of only \u003cstrong\u003e7W\u003c/strong\u003e, this \u003cstrong\u003eLED downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is an energy efficient powerhouse. Despite its low power consumption, it provides bright, crisp illumination with a \u003cstrong\u003e60-degree light angle\u003c/strong\u003e. Goodbye to high electricity costs and hello to a more environmentally friendly energy bill.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdjustable:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur LED Recessed Spotlight is not just another one on the market. Its\u003cstrong\u003e directional\u003c/strong\u003e design allows you to direct the light exactly where you need it, it \u003cstrong\u003erotates 360º\u003c/strong\u003e and has a \u003cstrong\u003e24º rotation\u003c/strong\u003e to adjust it according to the needs of each space. No more uncomfortable shadows or poorly lit areas - create the perfect atmosphere by simply adjusting the direction of the light!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnmatched Durability:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade of polycarbonate (PC), this LED downlight is tough and durable. Its high quality construction ensures that it will last for years without losing its splendor. No more worries about replacing bulbs or luminaires frequently.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy Installation:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstallation of this LED downlight is child\u0027s play. It comes with all the necessary instructions and parts, so you can have it up and running in minutes, no need to hire an electrician.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of 7W Black Circular LED Downlight - Adjustable - UGR19 - CCT\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e7W Black Circular LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is as versatile as it is powerful. You can use it in a variety of environments:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn your home:\u003c/span\u003e Enhance your living room, kitchen, bedroom, or any other space with this stylish and functional luminaire. Adjust the light color to create the perfect atmosphere at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn your office:\u003c/span\u003e Boost your productivity and create an ideal work environment with bright white light on your desk or workspace.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn stores and businesses:\u003c/span\u003e Highlight your products and attract customers with clear and attractive lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn restaurants and bars:\u003c/span\u003e Create a welcoming or lively atmosphere as needed, all with a single recessed LED downlight.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn commercial spaces:\u003c/span\u003e Whether it\u0027s an exhibition hall, art gallery, or any other location, this luminaire will add a special touch to your space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn summary, the \u003cstrong\u003e7W Circular White LED Downlight \u003c/strong\u003ewith\u003cstrong\u003e CCT\u003c/strong\u003e is the perfect lighting companion that offers control, efficiency, and durability. Add a touch of style to your environment and experience next-generation lighting. Don\u0027t wait any longer to make this wonder of lighting technology yours. Transform your spaces and create the perfect ambiance with just one click.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Empotrable-LED-7W-Circular.jpg\" alt=\"Downlight LED 7W 45° Round\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
